From 65adbcf4ac89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hemang Kumawat <HemangKumawat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:18:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7] coral: finish display, telemetry and wake diagnostics

Use the stock command-mode lane rate and required pixel clock parent. Preserve raw DSI faults while exposing the optional panel power-mode read through a serialized read-only attribute. Complete board reference-clock and wake wiring, temperature recovery and IIO read handling, and focused UART wake diagnostics.

Source commit: 65adbcf4ac89 (diff against 6315c883538b).
Assisted-by: AI agents (Codex, Claude) under the author's direction
---
